 seat 6 is Vera. So Jun must be in seat 6? No, seat 6 is taken.\\\\n\\\\nSo Jun must be in seat 6? No, seat 6 is Vera.\\\\n\\\\nSo Jun must be in seat 6? No, can't be.\\\\n\\\\nWait: Wren = 5 → Wren is to the left of Jun → so Jun must be in seat 6.\\\\n\\\\nBut seat 6 is Vera → conflict.\\\\n\\\\nSo Jun cannot be in seat 6.\\\\n\\\\nBut Wren = 5 → so Jun must be in seat 6 to be to the right of Wren.\\\\n\\\\nBut seat 6 is taken by Vera → contradiction.\\\\n\\\\nSo **Case 1 is impossible**.\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n### Case 2: Ivo = 6, Vera = 1\\\\n\\\\nSo:\\\\n- Ivo = 6\\\\n- Vera = 1\\\\n\\\\nNow, Wren and Vera are in neighboring seats. Vera = 1 → so Wren must be in seat 2 (only adjacent seat to 1 is 2).\\\\n\\\\nSo Wren = 2\\\\n\\\\nNow, Wren = 2 → Wren is to the left of Jun → so Jun must be in seat 3, 4, 5, or 6.\\\\n\\\\nBut Ivo is in 6 → so Jun can be in 3, 4, or 5.\\\\n\\\\nAlso, Hugo is to the left of Jun → Hugo < Jun\\\\n\\\\nNow, Nico is between Jun and Ivo.\\\\n\\\\nIvo = 6 → so Ivo is at the end.\\\\n\\\\nSo Nico is between Jun and Ivo → so Jun must be to the left of Ivo (which it is, since Ivo is 6), and Nico is between them → so Jun < Nico < Ivo = 6\\\\n\\\\nSo Jun < Nico < 6 → so Nico < 6 → Nico ≤ 5\\\\n\\\\nAlso, Jun < Nico → so Jun < Nico < 6\\\\n\\\\nSo Jun must be at least 1, but we already have:\\\\n- Seat 1: Vera\\\\n- Seat 2: Wren\\\\n- Seat 6: Ivo\\\\n\\\\nSo available seats: 3, 4, 5\\\\n\\\\nPeople left: Nico, Jun, Hugo\\\\n\\\\nSo Jun, Nico, Hugo must be in seats 3, 4, 5\\\\n\\\\nNow, Jun must be in 3\\\"},\\\"finish_reason\\\":\\\"length\\\",\\\"logprobs\\\":null}],\\\"model\\\":\\\"Qwen/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct\\\",\\\"created\\\":1794482879,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"prompt_tokens\\\":185,\\\"total_tokens\\\":1185,\\\"completion_tokens\\\":1000}}\",\"signature\":{\"text\":\"Qwen/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct:32073149ae72b9dba324c4dee5cd71a9b968378f6d6759923b4d1cfbf4f32082:0bd8097d80a64ccb832f000abdda047bd32677c11f34c331d996263cb0d559b6\",\"signature\":\