posite sides of Iris.\\\\n\\\\nWe have Xena < Dmitri < Gus → so Xena < Gus → so Iris must be between them: Xena < Iris < Gus\\\\n\\\\nAlso clue 6: Iris and Gus are in neighboring seats → |Iris - Gus| = 1\\\\n\\\\nSo Iris is immediately to the left of Gus (since Iris < Gus), so Iris = Gus - 1\\\\n\\\\nSo Iris is in seat immediately left of Gus.\\\\n\\\\nNow let’s try to assign positions.\\\\n\\\\nWe have:\\\\n\\\\n- Faye = 1  \\\\n- Tess < Xena < Dmitri < Gus  \\\\n- Iris = Gus - 1  \\\\n- Xena < Iris < Gus → so Xena < Iris = Gus - 1 < Gus\\\\n\\\\nSo Xena < Gus - 1 → so Xena ≤ Gus - 2\\\\n\\\\nSo Xena is at least 2 seats to the left of Gus.\\\\n\\\\nLet’s list the people: Faye, Xena, Dmitri, Gus, Iris, Tess → all six.\\\\n\\\\nWe have:\\\\n\\\\n- Faye = 1  \\\\n- Tess < Xena < Dmitri < Gus  \\\\n- Iris = Gus - 1  \\\\n- Xena < Iris → X\\\"},\\\"finish_reason\\\":\\\"length\\\",\\\"logprobs\\\":null}],\\\"model\\\":\\\"Qwen/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct\\\",\\\"created\\\":1794482879,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"prompt_tokens\\\":194,\\\"total_tokens\\\":1194,\\\"completion_tokens\\\":1000}}\",\"signature\":{\"text\":\"Qwen/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct:61c2c1a40bb894d59e02d0f4d2e86927ed0643df69e9685b4e98b3cec32ca1cc:7372b075c08e251cd9d849413f25dda06daacc8851988a0a4334f1e53e61eb6d\",\"signature\":\"0x50534bd14628786c323628f477285862eda1107d62189082265daa452345dff626193d96faadff9b6e50b7af963ad55fb238a9f666052e6e70d1edbcc6fd78811b\",\"signing_address\":\"0x2665cce942fa427ef30d87f4b0bff67fb7645462\",\"signing_algo\":\"ecdsa\",\"signature_kind\":\"provider_tee\"},\"verdict\":{\"ok\":false,\"reason\":\"no <answer> block\"}},{\"task\":2,\"model\":\"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash\",\"response\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b225b0d90fa6494a8824135f39ec59dc\\\",\\\"object\\\":\\\"chat.completion\\\",\\\"choices\\\":[{\\\"index\\\":0,\\\"message\\\":{\\\"role\\\":\\\"assistant\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<answer>Faye, Tess, Xena, Dmitri, Iris, Gus</answer>\\\",\\\"reasoning_content\\\":\\\"We need solve logic puzzle. Nee